Deserialize untrusted payloads into typed boundary DTOs or otherwise validate their required shape and formats, then use checked domain construction for business invariants. Alternatively route custom deserialization through the same validated construction path. Prevent public mutation/alternate construction from immediately bypassing the claimed invariant, and report boundary failures explicitly. Use the protocol's required schema checks without treating DTD processing as a universal prerequisite.
